140
00:14:11,300 --> 00:14:13,430
Nos deixe em paz!

141
00:14:26,150 --> 00:14:28,860
Dodonpa!

142
00:14:34,160 --> 00:14:35,370
E então?

143
00:14:35,370 --> 00:14:38,040
Você conseguiu, Sr. Ten!

144
00:14:52,050 --> 00:14:53,680
Sr. Ten!

145
00:14:53,680 --> 00:14:55,180
Droga!

146
00:15:07,690 --> 00:15:09,200
