Tenshinhan! Também vou fazer isso!

186
00:20:53,210 --> 00:20:54,120
Dodon...!

187
00:20:54,120 --> 00:20:57,540
Kamehame...!

188
00:20:57,540 --> 00:20:59,500
...pa!

189
00:20:59,500 --> 00:21:01,340
...ha!

190
00:21:36,000 --> 00:21:37,630
